    <p>the lambda calculus has been one of my favourite topics for a few years now, ever since an elective college class. one might call it my hyperfixation, one might also say i talk about it too much, and im gonna talk about it more i really like it. if you'll allow me, i'd like to introduce this computational model to you so you can enjoy it with me :3</p>
